@startuml UC006_Search_Suggestions_Backend_Sequence
!theme plain
title UC006 — Public user and project suggestions

actor "Visitor / signed-in user" as Viewer
boundary "frontend/feed/SearchSuggestions.jsx" as Client
participant "src/routes/search.routes.js" as Routes
participant "src/domain/searchRules.js" as Rules
participant "src/services/searchService.js" as Service
participant "src/db/database.js\n+ src/db/searchDatabase.js" as Data
database PostgreSQL as DB

Viewer -> Client : Type a user name or project title
Client -> Routes : GET /api/search/suggestions?q=...&limit=10
Routes -> Service : Get public suggestions
Service -> Rules : Validate q, limit, repeated/unknown parameters
Rules --> Service : Trimmed query and bounded limit

alt Fewer than two query characters
  Service --> Routes : query, empty suggestions, hasMore: false
  Routes --> Client : 200; no database lookup
else Valid searchable query
Service -> Data : Search account/profile names and published titles
Data -> DB : BEGIN; SET LOCAL statement_timeout = '2s'
Data -> DB : One parameterized statement; fixed normalization\nRank exact, then prefix, then substring\nDeduplicate aliases/projects; merge top candidates\nStable global order; LIMIT limit + 1
DB --> Data : Bounded public candidates
Data -> DB : COMMIT (clear transaction-local timeout)
Data --> Service : Ordered candidates
Service -> Service : Allowlisted DTOs; trim extra row; derive hasMore
Service --> Routes : query, suggestions, hasMore
Routes --> Client : 200 ordered suggestions / safe 503\nCache-Control: no-store
end

@enduml